    "claims": [
      {
        "text": "In Shang clan city, Fang Yuan asks several shops for a flash of inspiration Gu and finally buys one for twenty nine thousand primeval stones. It is a rank three consumable Gu, gone after one use. Recipe masters buy it when they are one step from finishing a new refinement recipe. Without his purple thorn token the shop would not sell. The Gu looks like a blue jewel tadpole. It enters his brain as white spiritual light and lets him see the fixed rhythm inside Li Ran’s messy daily habits.",
        "chapters": [
          282
        ],
        "certainty": "canon",
